        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1545_5589.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst etc. G. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>.
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgenoßen</unclear>. Von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uweren</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">truwten</unclear> lieben eidt: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtsgenoßen</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner">der
<lb n="4"/>Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Genf</unclear></orgName>, ist unns gestrigs abents ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernst</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/>hafft schryben zuokommen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dardurch</unclear> unns ver-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meldend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wasßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kö</unclear>: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>: zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Franckrych</placeName> sy
<lb n="7"/>durch den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heren</unclear> von <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Boysse</unclear></persName> einer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schnällen</unclear> be-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lägerung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">advisieren</unclear> laßen, daher
<lb n="9"/>sy unns umb ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getruwe</unclear> uffsehen zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erha</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rung</unclear>, so wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> als ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßers</unclear> weltschen
<lb n="11"/>landts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuocht</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepätten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deßen</unclear> wir
<lb n="12"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theils</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertröstet</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">amptlüthen</unclear> die gebür hierinnen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anbevohlen</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Und</unclear> als bemelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear> eidt: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtsgenoßen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>unns darneben ein schryben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerichtet</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogesendt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwyffel</unclear>, als wir achtend, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glychen</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/>innhalts, der meinung wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daßelbig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoscheff</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/>en wellen, haben wir uff der stundt daßelbig
<lb n="19"/>uff die fuoßpost <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeferggen</unclear> nit underlaßen
<lb n="20"/>wöllen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uch</unclear> unnd unns hieby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Götlicher</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>allmacht unnd protection wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befelchende</unclear>.
<lb n="22"/>Dat. den <origDate when="1607-04-22" resp="#ner">22. Aprilis 1607</origDate>.
<lb n="23"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Schultheiß unnd rath
<lb n="24"/>der statt Bern</orgName>.
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermeister und rath der statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1545_5590.jpg" n="2"/>
</p>
